# Design — Templates explorer

The brand sheet for the templates explorer — the Workbooks house style: paper + ink, Geist, a green
status accent, soft pastel category colours. Calm, documentation-grade.

design :brand do
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
  :root{
    --bg:#f7f6f1; --paper:#ffffff; --ink:#121316; --soft:#6b6b6e; --line:#e9e7df; --accent:#13a93a;
    --mint:#aee5c2; --sky:#a8d4f0; --peach:#f3c5a3; --cream:#f2ddb0; --sage:#c8e0b0;
    --display:'Geist',system-ui,sans-serif; --sans:'Geist',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --mono:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace; --radius:16px;
  }
end
